&lt;li&gt;Experience: 6+ years of accounting experience, including time in public accounting, with a proven ability to adapt and excel in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiative &amp;amp; Independence: Self-starter with a demonstrated ability to work independently, prioritize tasks, and meet tight deadlines with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
