&lt;li&gt;Identify gaps or inefficiencies within processes and suggest improvements to departmental leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform daily account maintenance requests while interacting and troubleshooting with internal partners for more sophisticated account issues related to customer accounts such as deactivating and reactivating accounts, levy notice processing, updating customer information ( CX, Legal, Compliance, Clearing Operations, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
