&lt;p&gt;Faire is committed to providing access, equal opportunity and reasonable accommodation for individuals with disabilities in employment, its services, programs, and activities. Accommodations are available throughout the recruitment process and applicants with a disability may request to be accommodated throughout the recruitment process. We will work with all applicants to accommodate their individual accessibility needs.&amp;nbsp; To request reasonable accommodation, please fill out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSczpI9me7nYKhunSC6AlagHKv75LHqfi-Qi2TP_3dpin0Uc9Q/viewform&quot;&gt;Accommodation Request Form&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://bit.ly/faire-form)&quot;&gt;https://bit.ly/faire-form)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For information about the type of personal data Faire collects from applicants, as well as your choices regarding the data collected about you, please visit Faire’s &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.faire.com/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.faire.com/privacy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice (https://www.faire.com/privacy)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4002179002,"name":"Algorithms & Data","child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":4000970002,"name":"San Francisco, CA","location":"San Francisco, California, United States","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4049474002}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app2.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8870975002/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://boards.greenhouse.io/faire/jobs/8899853002?gh_jid=8899853002","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":6565025002,"location":{"name":"San Francisco, CA"},"metadata":[{"id":4008562002,"name":"Employment Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8899853002,"updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:43:21-04:00","requisition_id":"1537","title":"AV Engineer","company_name":"Faire","first_published":"2026-10-19T09:55:10-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Faire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faire is a technology wholesale platform built on the belief that the future is local. Independent retailers around the globe collectively represent a multi-hundred-billion-dollar wholesale market that has historically been fragmented and offline. At Faire, we&#39;re using the power of tech, data, and machine learning to connect this thriving community of entrepreneurs across the globe. Picture your favorite boutique in town — we help them discover the best products from around the world to sell in their stores. With the right tools and insights, we believe that we can level the playing field so businesses can grow and local communities can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for smart, resourceful and passionate people to join us as we power the shop local movement. If you believe in community, come join ours.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep the workplace technology Faire runs on working, every day:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AV Operations team at Faire owns the technology people rely on to meet, present, and gather. That spans conference rooms and phone booths across our offices, large training rooms and event spaces, digital signage, office background music, and live event production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;AV Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own day-to-day operations for our standard rooms and workplace media systems. That means preventative maintenance, hands-on break/fix, and the content pipelines behind signage and music. You will be the dedicated operational owner on the team, and you will be hands-on running events with us, from Company All Hands to leadership onsites. You will be based onsite in our San Francisco office, where most of this work happens. You will also support our other offices remotely, with occasional travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role requires full-time presence in our San Francisco office five days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re excited about this role because…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want hands-on technical work and clear ownership of the systems you&#39;re responsible for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You measure your work by whether people can walk into a room and get started without thinking about the technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You would rather turn a recurring failure into a runbook, a standard, or a training session than fix it repeatedly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to be the person IT Ops and end users come to for AV, knowing they’ll receive excellent support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want exposure to complex AV work (Q-SYS, Dante, RF, large-format systems) by collaborating with senior AV engineers, with room to grow toward it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own preventative maintenance across our standard conference rooms and phone booths, covering displays, all-in-one video bars, controllers, schedulers, table mics, and in-room cabling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform daily room sweeps in our SF office and receive daily room sweep reports from IT Ops across other offices, triaging findings into a same-day fix, scheduled remediation, or a strategic project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the hands-on responder for AV tickets in standard rooms against defined response and resolution targets, diagnosing and repairing hardware, cabling, mounts, controllers, schedulers, and provisioning issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide remote resolution where possible through tools like Zoom Admin Portal and Logitech Sync for actions such as restarts, re-provisioning, and room setting updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep managed AV devices current within the update timelines set by IT Security, covering schedulers and iPads, Mac Mini codecs, and Logitech CollabOS devices. You will plan update waves, track compliance across the fleet, and flag devices that can&#39;t be updated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inspect displays for burn-in and image retention, enforce background rotation standards, and validate that display power schedules are applied and behaving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the digital signage content pipeline across offices, from intake and scheduling through publishing and expiration, and maintain templates so content ships at spec.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own day-to-day administration of office background music, including account approval, endpoint troubleshooting, zone volume, and scheduled on and off by office. You will enable our Workplace partners to manage their own playlists and zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain common-area displays and shared AV in lounges, cafés, gaming areas, and open spaces, and keep a documented spares inventory with reorder thresholds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep room records, as-built notes, SOPs, and runbooks current, and write repeatable procedures for IT Ops so first-line fixes don&#39;t have to reach you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and enable end users in our complex rooms and event spaces, covering source and display selection, Zoom Rooms controllers, UCI panel basics, wireless mic handling, and podium inputs. You are first-line guidance for teams self-running smaller live events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface patterns from daily sweeps, including repeat failures and rooms trending toward end of life, and feed that data into lifecycle and refresh planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support live events across our offices, from smaller-tier events teams self-run to full productions, covering setup, sound checks, mic handling, and day-of support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our senior AV engineers on DSP, Q-SYS, Dante, RF, and complex-room work, bringing them a documented diagnosis and staying on the problem with them through the fix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 to 4 years supporting AV, IT, or workplace technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with video conferencing room systems. Zoom Rooms strongly preferred, along with Logitech (Rally family, Tap, Sync) or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with displays, mounts, cabling, and HDMI and USB signal flow, backed by a real troubleshooting methodology rather than trial and error.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of networking fundamentals, including IP, VLANs, PoE, and DHCP, and how AV devices depend on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ticket-driven support experience with clear written documentation habits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A service orientation that holds up under pressure. This role is visible to employees and leadership in live meeting spaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The physical ability to work on ladders, lift equipment, and access ceilings and racks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll stand out if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital signage platform experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with commercial audio, including passive speaker systems, amplifiers, and DSP concepts at the operational level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to Q-SYS, Shure, or Dante environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MDM familiarity for Apple devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A live event or production support background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary range:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;San Francisco: the pay range for this role is $144,000 to $198,000 per year.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will also be eligible for equity and benefits. Actual base pay will be determined based on permissible factors such as transferable skills, work experience, market demands, and primary work location. The base pay range provided is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Hybrid Faire employees currently go into the office 3 days per week on Tuesdays, Thursdays, and a third flex day of their choosing (Monday, Wednesday, or Friday).&lt;/em&gt; Additionally, hybrid in-office roles will have the flexibility to work remotely up to 4 weeks per year. Specific Workplace and Information Technology positions may require onsite attendance 5 days per week as will be indicated in the job posting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you’ll love working at Faire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Move fast:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll own meaningful problems that serve customers around the globe with the agency to move fast and see your results clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equipped to scale:&lt;/strong&gt; We invest in what matters, including the latest enterprise AI tools, to help you work smarter and get more out of every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best in class:&lt;/strong&gt; Our team is full of sharp, kind, and generous colleagues who care about their craft and about helping you grow in yours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real rewards.&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive pay, equity, and comprehensive benefits designed to support your life inside and outside of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re intentional about building an environment where every Faire employee has equal access to opportunities, growth, and success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faire was founded in 2017 by a team of early product and engineering leads from Square. We’re backed by some of the top investors in retail and tech including: Y Combinator, Lightspeed Venture Partners, Forerunner Ventures, Khosla Ventures, Sequoia Capital, Founders Fund, and DST Global. We have headquarters in San Francisco and Kitchener-Waterloo, and a global employee presence across offices in Toronto, London, and New York. To learn more about Faire and our customers, you can read more on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.faire.com/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faire provides equal employment opportunities (EEO) to all employees and applicants for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, age, disability, genetics, sexual orientation, gender identity or gender expression.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faire is committed to providing access, equal opportunity and reasonable accommodation for individuals with disabilities in employment, its services, programs, and activities. Accommodations are available throughout the recruitment process and applicants with a disability may request to be accommodated throughout the recruitment process. We will work with all applicants to accommodate their individual accessibility needs.&amp;nbsp; To request reasonable accommodation, please fill out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSczpI9me7nYKhunSC6AlagHKv75LHqfi-Qi2TP_3dpin0Uc9Q/viewform&quot;&gt;Accommodation Request Form&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://bit.ly/faire-form)&quot;&gt;https://bit.ly/faire-form)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For information about the type of personal data Faire collects from applicants, as well as your choices regarding the data collected about you, please visit Faire’s &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.faire.com/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.faire.com/privacy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice (https://www.faire.com/privacy)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4075600002,"name":"Information Technology","child_ids":[4142548002],"parent_id":null}],"offices":[{"id":4000970002,"name":"San Francisco, CA","location":"San Francisco, California, United States","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4049474002}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://app2.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/8899853002/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://boards.greenhouse.io/faire/jobs/8906280002?gh_jid=8906280002","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":6567855002,"location":{"name":"New York City, NY; San Francisco, CA"},"metadata":[{"id":4008562002,"name":"Employment Type","value":"Regular","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8906280002,"updated_at":"2026-10-24T00:08:09-04:00","requisition_id":"1538","title":"Brand Success Manager","company_name":"Faire","first_published":"2026-10-21T17:17:46-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Faire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faire is a technology wholesale platform built on the belief that the future is local. Independent retailers around the globe collectively represent a multi-hundred-billion-dollar wholesale market that has historically been fragmented and offline. At Faire, we&#39;re using the power of tech, data, and machine learning to connect this thriving community of entrepreneurs across the globe. Picture your favorite boutique in town — we help them discover the best products from around the world to sell in their stores. With the right tools and insights, we believe that we can level the playing field so businesses can grow and local communities can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for smart, resourceful and passionate people to join us as we power the shop local movement. If you believe in community, come join ours.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mission of the Brand Success team is to partner with and coach the highest potential brands to most effectively utilize Faire’s wholesale platform - to grow their sales and simplify their operations. We are seeking a results-oriented customer success / account management professional to manage a book of ~250 brands. You will be responsible for engaging and coaching brands within your book on strateg

{"jobs":[{"absolute_url":"https://www.asana.com/jobs/apply/8165477?gh_jid=8165477","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":3533750,"location":{"name":"Vancouver, BC"},"metadata":[{"id":170878,"name":"Cost Center","value":"301 R&D Executive","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":1310287,"name":"Careers Page: Heading","value":"Engineering & Data","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":1310293,"name":"Careers Page: Team","value":"Administrative","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4809868,"name":"Careers Page: Location","value":[],"value_type":"multi_select"}],"id":8165477,"updated_at":"2026-09-18T12:50:39-04:00","requisition_id":"JR106339","title":"Administrative Business Partner","company_name":"Asana","first_published":"2026-09-18T12:50:39-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;The Administrative Business Partner (ABP) provides strategic, high-impact executive support to executives at Asana. This role operates as a trusted partner and is embedded within a collaborative ABP team that shares resources, best practices, and cross-functional coverage. The ABP is expected to build deep business acumen, operate with exceptional discretion, and drive operational excellence across a fast-moving, global organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our Vancouver office with an office-centric hybrid schedule. The standard in-office days are Monday, Tuesday, and Thursday. Most Asanas have the option to work from home on Wednesdays. Working from home on Fridays depends on the type of work you do and the teams with which you partner. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, your recruiter will share more about the in-office requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive &amp;amp; Calendar Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end calendar management with strong attention to accuracy, context-switching, and energy management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate the executive&#39;s needs before they arise, staying ahead of shifting priorities and schedule dependencies rather than reacting to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with EBPs and ABPs to rapidly drive calendar alignment across the leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex domestic and international travel arrangements, including customer-facing itineraries, office visit planning, meeting goals, AMAs, and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meeting &amp;amp; Communications Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive efficient meeting logistics including agendas, pre-reads, and follow-up actions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare the executive for key meetings through briefing materials and relevant context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and route communications on behalf of executives, including internal announcements, team messages, and channel communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a communication proxy where appropriate, maintaining professionalism and discretion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a hub of knowledge for the team — fielding questions, routing requests to the right owners, and finding answers even when they aren&#39;t immediately obvious&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Planning &amp;amp; Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end planning and execution of team events including all-hands, off-sites, end-of-quarter celebrations, and product launch celebrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functionally to manage logistics, timelines, and stakeholder alignment from start to finish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project, Program &amp;amp; Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and manage large, complex cross-functional projects with measurable business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track workstreams, surface blockers, and keep stakeholders aligned and informed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify operational gaps and build the processes to close them — not just managing existing workflows but creating structure where it doesn&#39;t yet exist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage Asana&#39;s own product and AI tools to design, document, and optimize operational workflows; helping leaders adopt and model best practices is a core expectation of this role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a working knowledge of key internal and external stakeholders to effectively interface on the executive&#39;s behalf across all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships across the organization, including with chiefs of staff, people partners, and other ABPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an extension of the executive in all internal and external interactions — anticipating their perspective, advancing their priorities, and representing them with professionalism and discretion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embody Asana&#39;s operating principles and mission in day-to-day work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate curiosity about AI tools and emerging technologies; actively use them to improve productivity, collaboration, and decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the continuous improvement of ABP team practices, knowledge-sharing, and team camaraderie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years supporting VP or C-Suite leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating across a global business with complex international logistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional discretion and judgment with confidential and sensitive information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong prioritization skills with the ability to analyze trade-offs and bring stakeholders along&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Composure and grace under pressure in a fast-paced, high-change environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with an in-person, office-centric hybrid schedule&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates curiosity about AI tools and emerging technologies, with a willingness to learn and leverage them to enhance productivity, collaboration, or decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Asana, we&#39;re committed to building teams that include a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills, as this is critical to helping us achieve our mission. If you&#39;re interested in this role and don&#39;t meet every listed requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’ll offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our comprehensive compensation package plays a big part in how we recognize you for the impact you have on our path to achieving our mission. We believe that compensation should be reflective of the value you create relative to the market value of your role. To ensure pay is fair and not impacted by biases, we&#39;re committed to looking at market value which is why we check ourselves and conduct a yearly pay equity audit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this role, the estimated base salary range is between 97,000 CAD–110,000 CAD. The actual base salary will vary based on various factors, including market and individual qualifications objectively assessed during the interview process. The listed range above is a guideline, and the base salary range for this role may be modified.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, your compensation package may include additional components such as equity, sales incentive pay (for most sales roles), and benefits. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more about the total compensation and benefits for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to provide equitable and competitive benefits packages that support our employees worldwide and include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health, wellness &amp;amp; fitness benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career coaching &amp;amp; support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive family building benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Long-term savings or retirement plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-office culinary options to cater to your dietary preferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These are just some of the benefits we offer, and benefits may vary based on role, country, and local regulations. If you&#39;re interviewing for this role, speak with your recruiter to learn more about the total compensation and benefits for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-SA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Asana is a leading platform for human + AI collaboration. Millions of teams around the world rely on Asana to achieve their most important goals, faster. Asana has been named to Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces for 7+ years and recognized by Fast Company, Forbes, and Gartner for excellence in workplace culture and innovation. We offer an exceptional office-centric culture while adopting the best elements of hybrid models to ensure that every one of our global team members can work together effortlessly. With 13+ offices all over the world, we are always looking for individuals who care about building technology that drives positive change in the world and a culture where everyone feels that they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation_31345133_root TypographyPresentation_31345133_root--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol_1625403506_highlightSol HighlightSol_1625403506_buildingBlock&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We believe in supporting people to do their best work and thrive. Our goal is to ensure that Asana upholds an environment where all people feel that they are respected and valued, whether they are applying for an open position or working at the company. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/div&gt;
