&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Asana is a leading platform for human + AI collaboration. Millions of teams around the world rely on Asana to achieve their most important goals, faster. Asana has been named to Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces for 7+ years and recognized by Fast Company, Forbes, and Gartner for excellence in workplace culture and innovation. We offer an exceptional office-centric culture while adopting the best elements of hybrid models to ensure that every one of our global team members can work together effortlessly. With 13+ offices all over the world, we are always looking for individuals who care about building technology that drives positive change in the world and a culture where everyone feels that they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TypographyPresentation_31345133_root TypographyPresentation_31345133_root--medium RichText3-paragraph--withVSpacingNormal RichText3-paragraph HighlightSol_1625403506_highlightSol HighlightSol_1625403506_buildingBlock&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We believe in supporting people to do their best work and thrive. Our goal is to ensure that Asana upholds an environment where all people feel that they are respected and valued, whether they are applying for an open position or working at the company. We provide equal employment opportunities to all applicants without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;LinkThemeablePresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation LinkPrimaryPresentation--sentimentSelected PrimaryLink HighlightSol HighlightSol--core HighlightSol--buildingBlock&quot; href=&quot;https://www.gem.com/form?formID=fbcdec8c-3442-43b9-9b45-d2b5f4ea25db&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Join Asana’s Talent Network&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to stay up to date on job opportunities and life at Asana.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":345526,"name":"AI GTM","child_ids":[],"parent_id":45382}],"offices":[{"id":21665,"name":"San Francisco","location":"San Francisco, California, United States","child_ids":[],"parent_id":79812}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.asana.com/jobs/apply/8092044?gh_jid=8092044","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":3505534,"location":{"name":"Warsaw"},"metadata":[{"id":170878,"name":"Cost Center","value":"537 Data Analytics","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":1310287,"name":"Careers Page: Heading","value":"Business & Marketing","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":1310293,"name":"Careers Page: Team","value":"Finance","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":4809868,"name":"Careers Page: Location","value":[],"value_type":"multi_select"}],"id":8092044,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T16:40:09-04:00","requisition_id":null,"title":"Analytical Engineer","company_name":"Asana","first_published":"2026-07-30T06:34:21-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;p&gt;The Data Science &amp;amp; Analytics team at Asana is how the company turns data into decisions — defi

{"jobs":[{"absolute_url":"https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/roles/8207928?gh_jid=8207928","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":3552447,"location":{"name":"Remote - Toronto"},"metadata":[{"id":110712,"name":"Employment Type","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":60505551,"name":"Job Family Group","value":"Sales","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8207928,"updated_at":"2026-10-17T15:30:00-04:00","requisition_id":"JR12216","title":"Account Development Representative - Canada","company_name":"Samsara","first_published":"2026-09-17T14:44:15-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the role:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sales Graduate at Samsara, you will be trained, both on-the-job and with formal training programs led by a high performing team of sales professionals, to develop into an Outbound Account Development Representative (ADR).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typical career path for a Sales Graduate includes 6-12 months in Sales Graduate Role, 18-24 months in an ADR role, then progression&amp;nbsp; to an Account Executive position.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a daily basis, you will be responsible for timely responses to inbound inquiries, expanding our list of prospects by finding new companies to target, and ultimately contributing to the generation of new business in EMEA for Samsara.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is remote friendly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You should apply if:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Your efforts will result in real-world impact—helping to keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores, reduce emissions, and most importantly, ensure workers return home safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are the architect of your own career:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you put in the work, this role won’t be your last at Samsara. We set up our employees for success and have built a culture that encourages rapid career development, countless opportunities to experiment and master your craft in a hyper growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re energized by our opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;The vision we have to digitize large sectors of the global economy requires your full focus and best efforts to bring forth creative, ambitious ideas for our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;At Samsara, we win together, celebrate together and support each other. You will be surrounded by a high-caliber team that will encourage you to do your best.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/blog/what-we-value-at-samsara/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Click here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to learn about what we value at Samsara.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a timely response to inquiries from prospective customers, and book demos of Samsara’s products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive weekly training on the Samsara way of selling, to be prepared for your next role in Sales as an outbound Account Development Representative (ADR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with ADR and Account Executives (AE, Mid Market and Enterprise) to find new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep meticulous records of interactions with leads in our CRM (Salesforce.com)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated and committed, with strong desire to work in target driven sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive and driven to succeed in a high-performing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and able to ask insightful questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A champion of a Growth Mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly Proficient in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6-12 months of work experience in a sales environment but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cold calling prospects (outbound lead generation)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of achievements beyond work (e.g. academics, sports, charity)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to help building a fast-growing business in the IoT and SaaS space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background, race,&amp;nbsp;national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, etc. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems. We are committed to increasing diversity across our team and ensuring that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Accommodations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;mailto:accessibleinterviewing@samsara.com&quot;&gt;accessibleinterviewing@samsara.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://form.asana.com/?k=dcecpJYeVpOJt1RCCU7Hdg&amp;amp;d=182866037607514&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full time employees receive an above market total compensation package along with employee-led remote and flexible working, health benefits, Samsara for Good charity fund, and much, much more. Take a look at our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;site to learn more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Flexible Working&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we have&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/blog/the-future-of-work-at-samsara/&quot;&gt;adopted a flexible way of working&lt;/a&gt;, enabling teams and individuals to do their best work, regardless of where they’re based. We value in-person collaboration and know a change of scenery and quiet space to work is welcomed from time to time, but also appreciate that the world of work has changed. Our offices remain open for those who prefer to collaborate or work in-office, but we also encourage fully remote applicants. As most roles are not required to be in the office, we are able to hire remotely where Samsara has an established presence. If a role is required to be in a certain location and candidates do not have work authorization for that location, Samsara will conduct an immigration assessment. If the role is not required to be in a specific location, Samsara will move forward with the remote location that works best for the business. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;col-span-2 pb-8&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;pb-8&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;post__content prose-xl dark:prose-invert&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: Samsara does not accept agency resumes and is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes. Please do not forward resumes to Samsara employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex flex-col gap-4 md:self-start md:sticky md:top-4&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;hidden md:flex flex-col gap-3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The compensation range shown spans approved pay zones for this role. Your primary work location determines the range applicable to you, which may be narrower than the full range displayed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Annual on-target earnings (OTE) range for full-time employees for this position is below and depends on your city of residence. Learn more about our total rewards and benefits below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual OTE Salary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$65,450&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$84,700 CAD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accessibleinterviewing@samsara.com&quot;&gt;accessibleinterviewing@samsara.com&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in @samsara.com, @us-greenhouse-mail.io or @mail3.guide.co. For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":78371,"name":"Account Development Representative","child_ids":[],"parent_id":303012}],"offices":[{"id":285531,"name":"Remote - Toronto","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":414531}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/roles/8260850?gh_jid=8260850","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":3362913,"location":{"name":"Remote - Germany"},"metadata":[{"id":110712,"name":"Employment Type","value":"Full-Time","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":60505551,"name":"Job Family Group","value":"Sales","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":8260850,"updated_at":"2026-10-22T05:45:00-04:00","requisition_id":"5296","title":"Account Development Representative - DACH","company_name":"Samsara","first_published":"2026-10-07T04:03:58-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Über die Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Account Development Representative (ADR) bei Samsara wirst du sowohl im Job als auch durch unser Trainingsprogramm, das von erstklassigen Vertriebsprofis geleitet wird, auf deine nächste Rolle als Account Executive vorbereitet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dein Tagesgeschäft: Du baust Pipelines für unser DACH-Geschäft auf und generierst durch proaktive Outbound-Ansprache neue Opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir haben Büros in London, Paris und Amsterdam und bieten Remote-Arbeit aus Deutschland, Frankreich, den Niederlanden und dem Vereinigten Königreich an.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dies ist eine Remote-Position für Kandidat:innen mit Wohnsitz in Deutschland, Frankreich, den Niederlanden oder im Vereinigten Königreich. Für die Position gelten Arbeitszeiten in MEZ (CET). Für diese Rolle wird keine Umzugsunterstützung angeboten.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Der Job passt zu dir, wenn …&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;… du die Branchen mitgestalten willst, die unsere Welt am Laufen halten:&lt;/strong&gt; Deine Arbeit hat realen Einfluss. Du hilfst dabei, dass die Lichter anbleiben, Lebensmittel in die Supermärkte kommen und, vor allem, dass Arbeiter:innen sicher nach Hause zurückkehren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;… du Architekt:in deiner eigenen Karriere bist:&lt;/strong&gt; Wenn du dich reinhängst, wird diese Rolle nicht deine letzte bei Samsara sein. Erfolgreiche ADRs können innerhalb von zwei Jahren oder weniger in eine Full Sales Cycle-Position aufsteigen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;… du gerne mit Menschen sprichst:&lt;/strong&gt; In dieser Rolle führst du durchschnittlich über 60 Anrufe pro Tag mit potenziellen Kund:innen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;… du von Natur aus neugierig bist, wie Unternehmen funktionieren:&lt;/strong&gt; An einem Tag sprichst du mit jemandem aus der Abfallwirtschaft, am nächsten lernst du das Innenleben eines Lebensmittel-Distributionszentrums kennen. Unsere besten Vertriebsmitarbeitenden wollen die Abläufe der Unternehmen, die sie betreuen, bis ins Detail verstehen, um mehr zu bewirken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;… du Ablehnung als Lernchance verstehst:&lt;/strong&gt; In dieser Rolle wird auch mal aufgelegt, und du wirst Absagen bekommen. Du brauchst die Resilienz, immer wieder zum Hörer zu greifen, um Samsaras Mission zu verkaufen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;… du mit den Besten arbeiten willst:&lt;/strong&gt; Samsaras leistungsorientierte Vertriebskultur bedeutet, dass du von den Besten umgeben bist und herausgefordert wirst, weiterzugehen als je zuvor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;In dieser Position wirst du:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pipeline aufbauen durch personalisierte Ansprache von Interessent:innen per Telefon, E-Mail und LinkedIn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;die Möglichkeit haben, an Messen und Events teilzunehmen, um die Marke Samsara zu repräsentieren und mit potenziellen Kund:innen und Partnern in Kontakt zu treten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;zur Produktexpertin bzw. zum Produktexperten werden und die Samsara-Art des Verkaufens lernen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;sorgfältig alle Interaktionen mit Accounts in unserem CRM (Salesforce.com) dokumentieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;die Kulturprinzipien von Samsara (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) vertreten, vorleben und verankern, während wir global und mit neuen Standorten weiter wachsen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Mindestanforderungen für die Position:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 Jahre Berufserfahrung, idealerweise in kundennahen Positionen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mindestens 6–12 Monate Vertriebserfahrung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hohe Motivation und Engagement sowie der ausgeprägte Wunsch, in einem zielorientierten Vertrieb zu arbeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachweisliche Erfolgsbilanz darin, die Ziele bzw. Erwartungen in früheren Rollen konstant zu übertreffen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hervorragende Kommunikationsfähigkeiten, mündlich und schriftlich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Neugier und die Fähigkeit, aufschlussreiche Fragen zu stellen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Überzeugte:r Verfechter:in eines Growth Mindsets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Englischkenntnisse und fließende Deutschkenntnisse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Idealerweise bringst du außerdem mit:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in Closing-Rollen im Vertrieb&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachweisliche Erfolge über den Beruf hinaus (z. B. in Studium, Sport, ehrenamtlichem Engagement, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bereitschaft, in einem „Win as a Team&quot;-Umfeld zusammenzuarbeiten und andere zu beeinflussen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Begeisterung dafür, neue Probleme auf innovative Weise zu lösen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation, ein schnell wachsendes Unternehmen im IoT- und SaaS-Bereich mitaufzubauen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ADR-Karrierepfade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Im ADR-Programm von Samsara gibt es stets Möglichkeiten, die nächste Stufe zu erreichen und mehr Verantwortung zu übernehmen, sowohl während des Programms als auch darüber hinaus. Wer hart arbeitet und sich schnell weiterentwickelt, kann seine Karriere vorantreiben. Mit dem Schwerpunkt auf kontinuierlicher Weiterentwicklung endet das Training nicht nach dem Onboarding: Wir bieten ADRs die Möglichkeit, ihr Verständnis für den Markt und unsere Wettbewerber zu vertiefen, die im Vertrieb notwendigen Skills auszubauen und gemeinsam mit Mentor:innen die drei Stufen unseres ADR-Programms zu durchlaufen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR I:&lt;/strong&gt; Die ADRs konzentrieren sich auf Inbound-Leads. Sie führen eine hohe Anzahl an Gesprächen, erklären die Produkte im Detail und bauen Beziehungen zu Interessent:innen auf, die sich für Samsara interessieren. Auf der Stufe ADR I bieten wir zahlreiche Lernmöglichkeiten, darunter Call-Sessions mit erfahreneren Mitgliedern des Sales-Teams sowie Schulungen zu Tools (Salesforce, Salesloft, Lusha), Produktwissen, Einwandbehandlung und mehr. Unsere ADRs auf dieser Stufe sind Macher:innen, die ihre Karriere durch die für sie geschaffenen Möglichkeiten vorantreiben können.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR II:&lt;/strong&gt; Die nächste Stufe im Programm. Hier arbeiten unsere ADRs am oberen Ende des Funnels, schaffen hochwertige Sales-Engagements und unterstützen unsere Account Executives. Mit dem Schritt in die Outbound-Arbeit kommen die ADRs auf Stufe II kontinuierlich mit neuen Lernmöglichkeiten in Berührung und nehmen an Spezialtrainings teil, u. a. zu professionellem Schreiben, personabasierter Ansprache, Cold Calling 2.0 sowie Zusammenarbeit und Kommunikation mit Account Executives. Nachdem sie ihre Outbound-Fähigkeiten aufgebaut und Sales-Zertifizierungen erworben haben, steigen unsere ADRs in die letzte Stufe des Programms auf.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ADR III:&lt;/strong&gt; Die höchste Stufe in unserer Organisation. Diese ADRs arbeiten Hand in Hand mit den Field Account Executives und Enterprise Regional Sales Managern bei Samsara. Sie betreuen gemeinsam große Accounts, setzen detaillierte Gebietspläne um, nehmen an wöchentlichen Strategiemeetings teil und planen Kunden-Demos bzw. nehmen daran teil. Außerdem nehmen ADR IIIs an einem Mentoring-Programm teil, in dem sie von Führungskräften des Account-Executive-Teams lernen, die ihnen Einblicke und Training ermöglichen, bevor sie sich im Interview für eine Account-Executive-Position beweisen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we build for the people who keep the global economy moving. We want owners, not passengers, which is why &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/benefits&quot;&gt;our rewards&lt;/a&gt; are designed to fuel high-impact builders. Our compensation program delivers above-market total compensation through a combination of base salary, performance-based bonus/variable pay, and equity (for eligible roles) in a high-growth public company. We meaningfully differentiate pay for our top performers, who have the opportunity to earn above-market compensation that can outpace the broader market over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond compensation, we provide the foundations that enable long-term success: a flexible, employee-led remote model, a professional development stipend, comprehensive health and parental leave plans, and more. If you’re ready to build for the long term and own the outcome, your journey starts here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Samsara, we embrace a flexible working model that caters to the diverse needs of our teams. Our offices are open for those who prefer to work in-person and we also support remote work where it aligns with our operational requirements. For certain positions, being close to one of our offices or within a specific geographic area is important to facilitate collaboration, access to resources, or alignment with our service regions. In these cases, the job description will clearly indicate any working location requirements. Our goal is to ensure that all members of our team can contribute effectively, whether they are working on-site, in a hybrid model, or fully remotely. All offers of employment are contingent upon an individual’s ability to secure and maintain the legal right to work at the company and in the specified work location, if applicable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Belonging at Samsara&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Samsara, we welcome everyone regardless of their background. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, national origin, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, protected veteran status, disability, age, and other characteristics protected by law. We depend on the unique approaches of our team members to help us solve complex problems and want to ensure that Samsara is a place where people from all backgrounds can make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is an inclusive work environment, and we are committed to ensuring equal opportunity in employment for qualified persons with disabilities. Please email &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accessibleinterviewing@samsara.com&quot;&gt;accessibleinterviewing@samsara.com&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DrM6DFQUiSgfPtCVA&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; if you require any reasonable accommodations throughout the recruiting process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Authenticity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use &lt;a href=&quot;https://hiretofu.com/privacyPolicy&quot;&gt;Tofu&lt;/a&gt;, a fraud detection tool, to validate the authenticity of applications and protect against identity fraud. This ensures we are connecting with real people and allows us to prioritize genuine candidates. Please see Samsara’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.samsara.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraudulent Employment Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in @samsara.com, @us-greenhouse-mail.io or @mail3.guide.co. For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":78371,"name":"Account Development Representative","child_ids":[],"parent_id":303012}],"offices":[{"id":79074,"name":"Germany","location":"Germany","child_ids":[285496],"parent_id":82091}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":null,"ai_opt_out_request_url":null},{"absolute_url":"https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/roles/7618026?gh_jid=7618026","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":true}],"internal_job_id":3362913,"location":{"name":"Remote - Germany"},"metadata":[{"id":110712,"name":"Employment Type","value":"Full-Time","value_type":"single_select"},{"id":60505551,"name":"Job Family Group","value":"Sales","value_type":"single_select"}],"id":7618026,"updated_at":"2026-10-14T06:00:00-04:00","requisition_id":"5296","title":"Account Development Representative - DACH","company_name":"Samsara","first_published":"2026-03-03T05:19:00-05:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Development Representative (ADR) at Samsara, you will be trained, both on the job and with formal training programs led by a world-class team of sales professionals, to take on your next role as closing Account Executive.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a daily basis, you will be responsible for sourcing pipelines for our EMEA business, generating opportunities via outbound outreach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have offices in London, Paris and Amsterdam and we offer remote working from Germany, France, The Netherlands and the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a remote position open to candidates based in Germany, France, The Netherlands and United Kingdom. This position requires working hours in CEST. Relocation assistance will not be provided for this role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world: &lt;/strong&gt;Your efforts will result in real-world impact—helping to keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores, and most importantly, ensure workers return home safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are the architect of your own career: &lt;/strong&gt;If you put in the work, this role won’t be your last at Samsara. Successful ADRs can see promotion to a closing role in two years or less.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You love talking to people: &lt;/strong&gt;In this role, you will average 60+ calls to prospective customers daily.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have an innate curiosity about how businesses work: &lt;/strong&gt;One day you’ll meet with someone in waste management and the next you may be learning about the inner workings of a food distribution center. Our top sales team members seek to learn the ins and outs of the businesses they support to make a larger impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You treat rejection as a learning experience:&lt;/strong&gt; In this role, you will get hung up on and you will get told no. You need to have the resilience to pick up the phone again and again to sell Samsara’s mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best: &lt;/strong&gt;Samsara’s high-performance Sales culture means you’ll be surrounded by the best and challenged to go farther than you have before.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive pipeline through personalised outreach to prospects via phone, emails and LinkedIn&lt;/li&gt;
